@startuml
title OC-D01 Operator Console System Context

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam wrapWidth 220

actor "Site Operator /\nSupervisor /\nAuditor /\nAdmin" as User

package "Operator Console Boundary" {
  component "Operator Console\nWeb UI / PWA" as ConsoleUi
  component "Optional Operator Console\nBFF / API Layer" as Bff
}

package "Approved Backend Services" {
  component "Identity / RBAC" as Identity
  component "Device Trust /\nShift Validation" as DeviceShift
  component "Central PMS" as Central
  component "Discount Workflow" as Discount
  component "Evidence Service /\nEvidence Repository" as Evidence
  component "Audit / Event" as Audit
}

component "Management Dashboard /\nReporting" as Dashboard
component "Future Fiscal\nException Queue" as FiscalQueue

package "Non-Direct Targets" {
  component "POS Server\n(fiscal issuer)" as PosServer
  component "Payment Orchestrator\n(provider boundary)" as Payment
  component "Vendor PMS\n(session/tariff authority)" as Vendor
  component "Gate Integration\n(consumes Central PMS auth)" as Gate
}

User --> ConsoleUi : internal operations access
ConsoleUi --> Bff : approved console API calls\nif BFF is used
ConsoleUi --> Identity : authenticate / session
ConsoleUi --> DeviceShift : device, site, shift checks
ConsoleUi --> Central : read session/payment/exit/fiscal context\nsubmit governed workflow requests
ConsoleUi --> Discount : statutory discount workflow\nthrough approved backend
ConsoleUi --> Evidence : evidence reference capture / review
ConsoleUi --> Audit : action and access audit

Bff --> Identity
Bff --> DeviceShift
Bff --> Central
Bff --> Discount
Bff --> Evidence
Bff --> Audit

Central --> Dashboard : reporting/read-model feed
Central --> FiscalQueue : future fiscal exception handoff
FiscalQueue --> Dashboard : aggregate exception visibility

ConsoleUi -[#red,dashed]-> PosServer : no direct calls
ConsoleUi -[#red,dashed]-> Payment : no direct provider calls
ConsoleUi -[#red,dashed]-> Vendor : no direct vendor calls
ConsoleUi -[#red,dashed]-> Gate : no direct gate calls

note bottom
Operator Console talks through approved backend services.
It does not call POS Server, payment providers, Vendor PMS, or gates directly.
end note

@enduml
